    "body": "Problem: Plugins or user scripts that want to define per-client behavior have to maintain their own data and lifecycle.\n\nSolution: Add a user_data field to the vim.lsp.Client class so custom data can be written there without triggering diagnostics.\n\nCloses: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/42363",
    "closed_at": null,
